Description: High-performance virtual secondary displays for Linux
 Orbiscreen creates virtual displays on Linux (Wayland/X11) and
 streams them with sub-frame latency to mobile devices or browsers.
 Supports hardware-accelerated H.264 encoding and low-latency input.
